{"strongs": "H6064", "word": "עָנַשׁ", "translit": "a.nash", "root": "ענש", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb denominative", "gloss": "fine, mulct", "definition": "[ עָנַשׁ ] verb denominative ( Gerber 61 f. ) fine, mulct ; — Qal Perfect consecutive וְעָֽנְשׁוּ Deut 22:19 (2 accusative); Imperfect וַיַּעֲנשׁ 2Chr 36:3 (2 accusative; || 2Kgs 23:33 above); Infinitive construct עֲנוֺשׁ Prov 17:26 ( לְ person); = punish (in general) עֲנָשֿׁ Prov 21:11 Passive participle עֲנוּשִׁם Amos 2:8 those fined , mulcted. Niph`al Imperfect + Qal Infinitive absolute עָנוֺשׁ יֵעָנֵשׁ Exod 21:22 ( E ) he shall be strictly fined ; more generally Perfect נֶעֱנָ֑שׁוּ Prov 22:3 be mulcted, punished = Prov 27:12 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6243')\">BDB6243</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6064')\">H6064</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6242')\">BDB6242</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6244')\">BDB6244</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>עָנַשׁ</bdbheb>] <b>verb denominative</b> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gerber')\">Gerber<sup>61 f.</sup></lookup>) <highlightword>fine, mulct</highlightword>; — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> consecutive <bdbheb>וְעָֽנְשׁוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 22:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,22,19)\">Deut 22:19</ref> (2 accusative); <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וַיַּעֲנשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,36,3)\">2Chr 36:3</ref> (2 accusative; || <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:33\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,33)\">2Kgs 23:33</ref> above); <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>עֲנוֺשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 17:26\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(20,17,26)\">Prov 17:26</ref> (<bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> person); = <highlight>punish</highlight> (in general) <bdbheb>עֲנָשֿׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 21:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,11)\">Prov 21:11</ref> <highlight>Passive participle</highlight> <bdbheb>עֲנוּשִׁם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 2:8\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,8)\">Amos 2:8</ref> <highlight>those fined</highlight>, <highlight>mulcted.</highlight> <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> + <b>Qal</b> <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>עָנוֺשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>יֵעָנֵשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 21:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,21,22)\">Exod 21:22</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) <highlight>he shall be strictly fined</highlight>; more generally <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>נֶעֱנָ֑שׁוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 22:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,22,3)\">Prov 22:3</ref> <highlight>be mulcted, punished</highlight> = <ref ref=\"Prov 27:12\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(20,27,12)\">Prov 27:12</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Deut 22:19", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 22, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "2Chr 36:3", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 36, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "2Kgs 23:33", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 23, "verse": 33}, {"raw": "Prov 17:26", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 17, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "Prov 21:11", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 21, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Amos 2:8", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 2, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Exod 21:22", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 21, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Prov 22:3", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 22, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Prov 27:12", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 27, "verse": 12}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["עָנַשׁ", "וְעָֽנְשׁוּ", "וַיַּעֲנשׁ", "עֲנוֺשׁ", "לְ", "עֲנָשֿׁ", "עֲנוּשִׁם", "עָנוֺשׁ", "יֵעָנֵשׁ", "נֶעֱנָ֑שׁוּ"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviat